    "changes": "Four Invocation identities on PDF p74 adapted into unavailable metadata with exact prerequisites, nonrepeatability, spell-slot exceptions, pact-weapon Attack action timing and Truesight range. Graph and mechanic keys are Edda additions. Canonical Warlock is external; Pact of the Blade and spells have separate owners. No executable support imported."
